---
import AgentHookTabs from './AgentHookTabs.vue';
---

<section class="section" id="agent-hooks" aria-labelledby="agent-hooks-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="agent-hooks-title">Sweep after every agent run</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
      Add Brooom as a stop hook and it cleans up each time your agent finishes. The hook runs
      the <a href="#presets">after-agents</a> preset with <code>--yes</code>, so nobody has to answer: the
      preset only removes merged worktrees and branches and agent leftovers, never unmerged or
      uncommitted work, and <code>br undo</code> restores the last sweep. The report goes to stderr,
      because the harness reads stdout as JSON.
    </p>
    <AgentHookTabs client:visible />
    <noscript>
      <style is:inline>
        #agent-hooks [role='tablist'] {
          display: none;
        }
        #agent-hooks [role='tabpanel'][hidden] {
          display: block;
          margin-top: var(--space-5);
        }
      </style>
    </noscript>
  </div>
</section>
